     "nota": "⚠️ **halv** points forward to the NEXT hour: **halv 4** = 3:30 (half towards 4), as in German. Between 20 past and 20 to, it's counted from the half hour: 5 minutter **i halv** 2 = 1:25.",
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Going by…",
     "texto": [
      "- **tage med** bus/tog/fly: Jeg tager altid **med** tog til Tyskland.\n- **køre på cykel**: go by bike.\n- **ride** only for horses: Han **red** til byen.\n- **gå** = only on foot."
     ],
     "tutora": "pensando"
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Me too / Me neither",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "Sentence",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "Reply",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      }
     ],
     "filas": [
      [
       {
        "texto": "Jeg **vil** ud at rejse.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Det **vil** jeg **også**.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "Jeg **kan** ikke drikke stærk kaffe.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Det **kan** jeg **heller ikke**.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "Jeg **elsker** sol.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Det **gør** jeg **også**.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       }
      ],
      [
       {
        "texto": "Jeg **gad** ikke komme.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       {
        "texto": "Det **gjorde** jeg **heller ikke**.",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       }
      ]
     ],
     "nota": "You repeat the verb (or **gør/gjorde**) with **det** in front.",
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "24-hour clock",
     "texto": [
      "At stations and airports the 24-hour clock is used, and you read it figure by figure:\n\n- 15.03 → **femten nul tre**\n- 21.17 → **enogtyve sytten**\n- 17.30 → **sytten tredive**"
     ],
     "tutora": "pensando"
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "More time tricks",
     "texto": [
      "- With the hour on the dot, **klokken** is compulsory: Vi kommer **klokken 4**.\n- With minutes, it can be left out: Vi kommer ti minutter over 4.\n- There's no a.m./p.m.: you say **om formiddagen** / **om eftermiddagen**.\n- **lidt i tolv** = a bit before twelve · **lidt over tolv** = a bit after.\n- **godt tolv** can be a bit before **or** a bit after twelve.\n- Remember: **halv ti** = 9:30. English «half ten» = **halv elleve**."
     ],
     "tutora": "pensando"
    }
   ]
